# Use Bun, not Node/npm/vite/pnpm

This project is Bun-first. Prefer Bun tooling and APIs.

- Package manager: `bun install` (not npm/pnpm/yarn)
- Scripts: `bun run …` / `bun test` (not `npm run` / `npx`)
- Runtime APIs: prefer `bun` builtins (`Bun.file`, `Bun.spawn`, etc.) over Node equivalents when they exist
- Do not introduce Vite, webpack, or other Node-centric bundlers unless an existing path already requires them
- Dev dependency installs: `bun add -d <pkg>`

If a tool only exists as an npm CLI, run it via `bunx` rather than `npx`.
